                            <comment id="16526303" author="amashenkov" created="Thu, 28 Jun 2018 13:28:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve found the root cause.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We have a collection that never cleared:&#160; GridCacheQueryFutureAdapter.allCol and it is reachable from GC root while&#160;GridCacheDistributedQueryFuture is reachable.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16526318" author="amashenkov" created="Thu, 28 Jun 2018 13:51:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;So, the issue here is ScanQuery.keepAll to true by default.&lt;br/&gt;
This bug affects all type of queries. Cache.iterator() works fine as it explicitly disabled keepAll flag.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There is no workaround as keepAll flag is internal feature and can&apos;t be set from user side.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16526584" author="amashenkov" created="Thu, 28 Jun 2018 17:24:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Seems, we can get rid of keepAll flag and allCol collection as most likely noone use future result.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;TC test looks fine.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16534850" author="edshanggg" created="Fri, 6 Jul 2018 14:11:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi, guys.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I don&apos;t see any new tests. Is it impossible to add new one which would check no OOM?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
